A UE in (NG)EN-DC executes a subclause of clause 5 in this specification:

1. When the subclause is referred to from a subclause under execution, either in this specification or in TS 36.331;
2. When the subclause applies to a message received on SRB3 (if SRB3 is established);
3. When the subclause applies to field(s), IE(s), UE variable(s) or timer(s) in this specification that the UE is configured with.

